- chiavi i18n nuove in IT/EN/ES/FR + ri-render area YUMA al cambio lingua
- supabase/100-aree-riservate.sql: is_yuma() + template RLS per la futura area download
- tests/aree-riservate.test.js: 29 controlli jsdom (ospite/socio/yuma/pending/admin/logout)
